{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>LET THE DICE DECIDE YOUR FATE</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756340/extras/66032e69da77870998e7b49fe5fc557d.poster.avif?t=1773222060\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756340/extras/66032e69da77870998e7b49fe5fc557d.webm?t=1773222060\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756340/extras/66032e69da77870998e7b49fe5fc557d.mp4?t=1773222060\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master multiple types of dice, each with its own unique effect. Carefully choose your combination for every roll. It\u2019s the only way to outsmart Death itself.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>HIGH-STAKES SURVIVAL</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756340/extras/f69ab43b7ef321eefbc21830ca92d17f.poster.avif?t=1773222060\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756340/extras/f69ab43b7ef321eefbc21830ca92d17f.webm?t=1773222060\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756340/extras/f69ab43b7ef321eefbc21830ca92d17f.mp4?t=1773222060\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your luck at the Roulette table, the Wheel of Fortune, or the Dice Station. One lucky roll can buy your freedom... but a single mistake might cost you your very soul.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>SPEND OR PERISH</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756340/extras/cbc4cb461bf258823abba350551eafef.poster.avif?t=1773222060\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756340/extras/cbc4cb461bf258823abba350551eafef.webm?t=1773222060\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756340/extras/cbc4cb461bf258823abba350551eafef.mp4?t=1773222060\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn gold and spend it wisely. Can\u2019t pay the price? You won't survive the night. Manage your riches with caution. Death is quite picky with its gold.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>CHEAT TO WIN</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756340/extras/58009451ceba00e11b6663fc132b9860.poster.avif?t=1773222060\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756340/extras/58009451ceba00e11b6663fc132b9860.webm?t=1773222060\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756340/extras/58009451ceba00e11b6663fc132b9860.mp4?t=1773222060\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use powerful artifacts and boosters to bend the rules and rig the results in your favor. When luck isn't on your side, it\u2019s time to resort to dirty tricks and clever manipulation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>THE GRIM REAPER WELCOMES YOU</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756340/extras/d386336927c80647f620f6aa15f1dcdf.poster.avif?t=1773222060\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756340/extras/d386336927c80647f620f6aa15f1dcdf.webm?t=1773222060\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756340/extras/d386336927c80647f620f6aa15f1dcdf.mp4?t=1773222060\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are alone with Death, surrounded by a mystical atmosphere and the shadows of wandering souls. In this cold, ethereal void, Death never blinks. Its eyes follow your every move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3756340?t=1773222060","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3756340?t=1773222060","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756340/36b9069f4b9e6b7e4b796259796a7fb86c2fdb08/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773222060","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756340/36b9069f4b9e6b7e4b796259796a7fb86c2fdb08/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773222060","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>LET THE DICE DECIDE YOUR FATE</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756340/extras/66032e69da77870998e7b49fe5fc557d.poster.avif?t=177322206